OL,3,GNEWSAMystery as note from Thatcher
OL,4,Afound in restaurant
OL,5,
OL,6,FA restaurant has stumbled across a
OL,7,Fmystery note from Margaret Thatcher
OL,8,Ftucked away in a wooden beam above its
OL,9,Fbar.
OL,11,FThe 41-year-old thank you letter, sent
OL,12,Fon behalf of the former prime minister,
OL,13,Fwas found at Florios pizzeria in
OL,14,FScarborough, North Yorkshire.
OL,16,FAccording to owner Max Sini, the
OL,17,Frestaurant has a long-standing
OL,18,Ftradition of displaying letters,
OL,19,Fdrawings and memories from staff and
OL,20,Fcustomers in the beam.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
